            "sid": "EZR 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba numba ya ng'wa Halimu baalī shihūmbī n'ikūmi na mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī ba numba ya ng'wa Yeshua na Kadimieli, (bahilya Hodavia) baalī makūmi mpungatī na bane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bīmbi ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Asafu baalī igana na makūmi abīlī na banaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balang'hani ba ha milyango ya ha hekalu, ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Shalumu, Ateeli, Talimoni, Akubu, Hatita, na Shobai. A benaba baalī igana na makūmi adatū na kenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
